@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Hexalith.Memories.EventStoreExtensions
+
+Provides the Memories-owned route and idempotency adapters for the existing internal DomainService commands in local and CI routing catalogs. The gateway discovers this package through its owner adapter declaration.
+
+These policies grant no hosted acceptance and expose no additional public search or ingestion operations.
